{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50296","headline":"首秋闻雁幷怀敦煌知己 · 佚名","name":"首秋闻雁幷怀敦煌知己","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"戎庭节物由来早，倐忽霜秋被寒草。\n旅雁噰噰□□□，覊人夜夜心如捣。\n与君离别恨经年，何事音书遂黯然。\n肠断只今□□□，知西北泣云烟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"佚名","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50296.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50296","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}